out, ce qu\'on voit à travers ce choc, c\'est que la voiture a encaissé un maximum d\'énergie en nous en préservant dans l\'habitacle.\", \"start\": 930.04, \"words\": [{\"end\": 930.34, \"text\": \"Bah\", \"start\": 930.04, \"confidence\": 0.6191}, {\"end\": 930.58, \"text\": \"surtout,\", \"start\": 930.34, \"confidence\": 0.8794}, {\"end\": 930.74, \"text\": \"ce\", \"start\": 930.66, \"confidence\": 0.9985}, {\"end\": 930.8, \"text\": \"qu\", \"start\": 930.74, \"confidence\": 0.999}, {\"end\": 930.82, \"text\": \"\'on\", \"start\": 930.8, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 931.04, \"text\": \"voit\", \"start\": 930.82, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 931.16, \"text\": \"à\", \"start\": 931.04, \"confidence\": 0.9976}, {\"end\": 931.58, \"text\": \"travers\", \"start\": 931.16, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 931.82, \"text\": \"ce\", \"start\": 931.58, \"confidence\": 0.9995}, {\"end\": 932.16, \"text\": \"choc,\", \"start\": 931.82, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 932.3, \"text\": \"c\", \"start\": 932.18, \"confidence\": 0.998}, {\"end\": 932.4, \"text\": \"\'est\", \"start\": 932.3, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 932.44, \"text\": \"que\", \"start\": 932.4, \"confidence\": 0.9995}, {\"end\": 932.56, \"text\": \"la\", \"start\": 932.44, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 932.8, \"text\": \"voiture\", \"start\": 932.56, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 932.96, \"text\": \"a\", \"start\": 932.8, \"confidence\": 0.999}, {\"end\": 933.42, \"text\": \"encaissé\", \"start\": 932.96, \"confidence\": 0.9997}, {\"end\": 933.54, \"text\": \"un\", \"start\": 933.42, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 933.94, \"text\": \"maximum\", \"start\": 933.54, \"confidence\": 0.9995}, {\"end\": 934.16, \"text\": \"d\", \"start\": 933.94, \"confidence\": 0.9995}, {\"end\": 934.38, \"text\": \"\'énergie\", \"start\": 934.16, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 934.82, \"text\": \"en\", \"start\": 934.38, \"confidence\": 0.9053}, {\"end\": 935, \"text\": \"nous\", \"start\": 934.82, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 935.2, \"text\": \"en\", \"start\": 935, \"confidence\": 0.999}, {\"end\": 935.8, \"text\": \"préservant\", \"start\": 935.2, \"confidence\": 0.9995}, {\"end\": 935.9, \"text\": \"dans\", \"start\": 935.8, \"confidence\": 0.9995}, {\"end\": 935.94, \"text\": \"l\", \"start\": 935.9, \"confidence\": 0.999}, {\"end\": 936.34, \"text\": \"\'habitacle.\", \"start\": 935.94, \"confidence\": 0.9995}], \"confidence\": 0.8998}, {\"end\": 938.34, \"text\": \"On a découvert plein de choses, mais on a surtout un problème.\", \"start\": 936.46, \"words\": [{\"end\": 936.56, \"text\": \"On\", \"start\": 936.46, \"confidence\": 0.9995}, {\"end\": 936.68, \"text\": \"a\", \"start\": 936.56, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 937.02, \"text\": \"découvert\", \"start\": 936.68, \"confidence\": 0.9993}, {\"end\": 937.18, \"text\": \"plein\", \"start\": 937.02, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 937.28, \"text\": \"de\", \"start\": 937.18, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 937.46, \"text\": \"choses,\", \"start\": 937.28, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 937.66, \"text\": \"mais\", \"start\": 937.52, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 937.72, \"text\": \"on\", \"start\": 937.66, \"confidence\": 0.9995}, {\"end\": 937.8, \"text\": \"a\", \"start\": 937.72, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 937.96, \"text\": \"surtout\", \"start\": 937.8, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 938.1, \"text\": \"un\", \"start\": 937.96, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 938.34, \"text\": \"problème.\", \"start\": 938.1, \"confidence\": 1}], \"confidence\": 0.8998}, {\"end\": 943.12, \"text\": \"La voiture fonctionne encore, malgré une fuite de liquide d\'enfant-dissement, ce qui nous empêchera pas de faire une étape de plus.\", \"start\": 938.54, \"words\": [{\"end\": 938.72, \"text\": \"La\", \"start\": 938.54, \"confidence\": 0.9995}, {\"end\": 939.02, \"text\": \"voiture\", \"start\": 938.72, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 939.36, \"text\": \"fonctionne\", \"start\": 939.02, \"confidence\": 1}, {\"end\": 939.72, \"text\": \"encore,\", \"sta